category: Libs
requires: libls-qpack2 libxxhash-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "QPACK compression library for use with HTTP/3 (development)"
ldesc: "QPACK is the compression mechanism used by HTTP/3 to compress HTTP headers. It
is in the process of being standardazed by the QUIC Working Group. The QPACK
Internet-Draft is has been stable for some time and we don't expect functional
changes to it before the final RFC is released."
external-source: ls-qpack

